{"id":"clavo","lemma":"clavo","pos":"noun","rank":3924,"glosses":["nail, spike","clove","corn (callus)"],"ipa":"/ˈklabo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"clavos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-clavo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito una caja de clavos.","en":"I need a box of nails.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454244","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"box, case"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Realmente eso dio en el clavo.","en":"That really hit the spot.","words":[{"g":"really"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"El clavo atravesó la pared.","en":"The nail went through the wall.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77669","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to cross, to traverse","l":"atravesar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"wall"}]},{"text":"Consigan un martillo y clavos.","en":"Get a hammer and nails.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461922","words":[{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"hammer"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Un clavo pinchó el neumático.","en":"A nail penetrated the car tire.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to puncture","l":"pinchar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"pneumatic"}]}]}